+- PASS: Buying guide engine matches How-to / Education and Buying Guide intent.
+- PASS: Week 6 CSV has no supporting keyword or competitor URL columns. Related phrases are reported as inferred.
+- PASS: Fourteen major H2s are mapped as primary-backed or intent-inferred. No inferred H2 claims volume or KD.
+- PASS: Direct answer and TL;DR appear near the top.
+- PASS: One live H1, fourteen H2s, one purity table, seven visible FAQs.
+- PASS: Live visible word count is 2730.
