+## WordPress and schema
+
+- PASS: Author is Vikas, user ID 270271338.
+- PASS: Categories are Gold 554493348 and Jewellery Problem & Solution 554493465.
+- PASS: Featured media is 34812.
+- PASS: FAQPage JSON-LD has seven questions.
+- PASS: BlogPosting JSON-LD has nine images and the correct canonical URL.
